<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Alice: An Interpretable Neural Architecture for Generalization in Substitution Ciphers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Additional interpretability figures</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A7" title="In Alice: An Interpretable Neural Architecture for Generalization in Substitution Ciphers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G </span>Decoding speed</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A8" title="In Alice: An Interpretable Neural Architecture for Generalization in Substitution Ciphers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">H </span>Where existing LLMs fail</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
<div id="infobox" class="infobox">
