<span id="A8.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">give you the </span><span id="A8.I1.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">final plaintext only, or</span></span>
