<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A8.F13.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 13</span>: </span><span id="A8.F13.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">This example used the extended thinking option. The plaintext is “SIMPLICITY SAVES STRENGTH.” Our 85M parameter model outputs “SIMPLICITY SOUES STRENGTH.”, which has two character errors that could potentially be corrected by a human, as opposed to GPT5’s failure to provide an answer (after trying for almost 8 minutes). See the conversation and reasoning at https://chatgpt.com/share/689643c1-3690-8011-b8ae-61f0cede7aa1.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
